   "design": "Patients book and reschedule online and get automatic reminders from the practice system, so fewer booking calls come in and no reminder calls are made. The stock list holds reorder points and drafts the supply order from the count, which the aide checks and sends. Referral and insurer forms fill from the practice record and claims go out from the treatment record, instead of copying details by hand. Phones for other matters, counting, restocking, the desk and filing stay with the aide.",
